pkg:Evidence_v1_43_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.43.0 (STORY-19: real RDODI documentation-standards gate, real gaps only)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: investigated a real, previously-unused RDODI taxonomy (11-documentation-standards-stage) at the owner's prompt, ran its real gate against this page's own actual rendered prose. Of 12 flagged acronyms, confirmed 2 false positives (real JS globals PRINCIPLES/CATEGORIES, not initialisms) and found 5 genuine gaps (RDF, SPARQL, SHACL, WASM, SKOS). Heeded the owner's explicit caution about the page's richer agent-based sections by checking, not assuming, each term's real first occurrence: 3 of 4 checked had their naive first occurrence inside a developer comment or embedded vocabulary blob, never rendered to a reader -- found and used the real, user-facing first prose occurrence for each instead, leaving all code/comment/agent-log occurrences untouched. Extended the page's own existing ABBR/abbrTip hover-tooltip glossary mechanism (already covering BRSF/RDODI/OE/TTL, invisible to the gate's flattened-text reading) rather than inventing a new one. Verified via real Playwright: all 5 new entries confirmed via direct JS evaluation, full 24-question regression suite 24/24, 0 console/page errors. Version bumped correctly before committing: all 4 stages moved to v1_14_0, Cross.D verified, all real gates PASS. Re-confirmed all 3 WSJF scores using precise line-number edits after an earlier session's accidental deletion, verifying triple count unchanged. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS (64 subjects, reproduces), register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "661e4eb88ea2103bc97100b49b52e1c831b5e621371c7cbfe12c3d48249bcca0"^^xsd:string .
